      "start_seconds": 6.64,
      "end_seconds": 10.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "of course, leave it there how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.32,
      "end_seconds": 18.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, it's a hoarse voice. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.98,
      "end_seconds": 22.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.99,
      "end_seconds": 31.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.63,
      "end_seconds": 53.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Okay, did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.55,
      "end_seconds": 76.23,
      "duration_seconds": 21.68,
      "text": "for two years, I'd say. I did try to ignore it for a while. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. Oh, and a little breathlessness. As for little breathlessness, I'd say all the time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.78,
      "end_seconds": 81.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "A few quick ones: fever, weight loss or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.34,
      "end_seconds": 85.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "right, no, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.75,
      "end_seconds": 91.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "how are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.59,
      "end_seconds": 96.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "No, you know, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.56,
      "end_seconds": 102.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.19,
      "end_seconds": 105.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "not really, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.65,
      "end_seconds": 108.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.62,
      "end_seconds": 111.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.37,
      "end_seconds": 119.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.37,
      "end_seconds": 124.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "No, uh, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.13,
      "end_seconds": 142.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.35,
      "end_seconds": 148.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.1,
      "end_seconds": 153.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.71,
      "end_seconds": 159.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.11,
      "end_seconds": 163.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.46,
      "end_seconds": 175.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.73,
      "end_seconds": 204.27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.54,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 80 beats a minute, respiratory rate 14. And pressure 122 over 72, saturation 98 percent, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.58,
      "end_seconds": 208.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Is that that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.79,
      "end_seconds": 211.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.9,
      "end_seconds": 218.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.75,
      "end_seconds": 222.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.46,
      "end_seconds": 237.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "your chest is clear and there is no wheeze"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.73,
      "end_seconds": 242.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.26,
      "end_seconds": 270.79,
      "duration_seconds": 13.53,
      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking. It points towards a persistent dry cough without a clear cause so far. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.38,
      "end_seconds": 273.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.53,
      "end_seconds": 295.37,
      "duration_seconds": 19.84,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like a persistent dry cough without a clear cause so far, but I'd like to confirm just to be sure I understood you've had a hoarse voice for two years, and no coughing up blood or fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.63,
      "end_seconds": 297.33,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.16,
      "end_seconds": 331.12,
      "duration_seconds": 22.96,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a breathing test for cough. I'd like to arrange a chest X-ray for chronic cough. We will review your tablets and see whether the cough settles over a month. Let's plan a check in four weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.18,
      "end_seconds": 335.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.52,
      "end_seconds": 338.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Okay, see you soon."
    }
  ]
